+// Neon: these two helpers live in Brave's chromium_src overrides of
+// chrome/browser/ui/navigator/browser_navigator.cc and
+// chrome/browser/ui/browser_tabrestore.cc. They are moved into a file of their
+// own so the hunks in those Chromium files stay one call each, as Brave master
+// does with containers_navigator_utils.cc.
+
